// a solid block for the tower climb: can't walk or jump through it from any side.
// stretch it in the room editor (image_xscale / image_yscale) to make floors and walls.
// it shows as a grey placeholder until you've got tiles over it (then set plat_show_solids to false in obj_plat_controller)
image_blend = make_color_rgb(90, 90, 110);